{"est_no":"167-31980","est_id":"9083","name":"Early Learning Center","est_type":"School","address":"2501 South 1st Street","city":"Springfield","state":"IL","zip":"62704","visits":[{"id":"818380","date":"2026-09-24","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":1,"grp":1,"label":"Needs attention","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=818380&INSPECTION_NN=818380","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":2,"title":"Certified Food Protection Manager (CFPM).","repeat":false,"comment":"Inspector observed no certified food protection manager (CFPM) present during today’s visit. The PIC’s certification expired on 8/10/2026. The PIC has plans to take the exam at the District 186 Office. Ensure there is a CFPM present prior to the next routine inspection.","citation":"2-102.12(A)","citation_text":"2-102.12(A) Certified Food Protection Manager. (A) The PERSON IN CHARGE shall be a certified FOOD protection manager who has shown proficiency of required information through passing a test that is part of an ACCREDITED PROGRAM."},{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and cleaned.","repeat":false,"comment":"Repeat Violation\n\nThe inspector observed the triple sink to be missing its sealant at the back of the sink. The sink needs to be sealed to the wall to prevent water and microbial accumulation. Ensure this repair is complete prior to the next routine inspection.","citation":"6-101.11(A)(1)","citation_text":"6-101.11(A)(1) Surface Characteristics. (A) Except as specified in (B) of this section, materials for indoor floor, wall, and ceiling surfaces under conditions of normal use shall be: (1) SMOOTH, durable, and EASILY CLEANABLE for areas where FOOD ESTABLISHMENT operations are conducted."}]},{"id":"607172","date":"2026-02-02","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":1,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=607172&INSPECTION_NN=607172","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":55,"title":"Physical facilities installed, maintained, and cleaned.","repeat":false,"comment":"The inspector observed the triple sink to be missing its sealant at the back of the sink. The sink needs to be sealed to the wall to prevent water and microbial accumulation. The PIC was informed and stated that maintenance was performed on the sink over the summer. The PIC has plans to submit a work order for repair. Ensure this repair is complete prior to the next routine inspection.","citation":"6-101.11(A)(1)","citation_text":"6-101.11(A)(1) Surface Characteristics. (A) Except as specified in (B) of this section, materials for indoor floor, wall, and ceiling surfaces under conditions of normal use shall be: (1) SMOOTH, durable, and EASILY CLEANABLE for areas where FOOD ESTABLISHMENT operations are conducted."}]},{"id":"589535","date":"2025-09-11","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=589535&INSPECTION_NN=589535","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"531823","date":"2025-01-30","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=531823&INSPECTION_NN=531823","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"514962","date":"2024-08-30","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=514962&INSPECTION_NN=514962","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"488234","date":"2024-01-26","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=488234&INSPECTION_NN=488234","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"473558","date":"2023-09-12","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=473558&INSPECTION_NN=473558","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"446096","date":"2023-02-10","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=446096&INSPECTION_NN=446096","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"433767","date":"2022-10-06","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=433767&INSPECTION_NN=433767","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":13,"title":"Food in good condition, safe, and unadulterated","repeat":false,"comment":"3-202.15: FOOD packages shall be in good condition and protect the integrity of the contents so that the FOOD is not exposed to ADULTERATION or potential contaminants. \nFive packages of ham were observed to have holes in them when removed from freezer and thawing method. The manager noticed holes in ham packages this morning, when the sheet pan used during thawing, had ham juice on it. Mor holes were observed after ham was removed from thawing in water and water was running out of the ham packages. All together 25 pounds of ham were discarded due to packaging that was not intact. Some holes were as large as a pencil eraser while others were smaller but still exposed the food inside to potential contamination. This is the first time that this kitchen has used this ham product. Normally they use turkey ham and have not had any previous issue with packaging that is not intact.","citation":"","citation_text":""}]},{"id":"406935","date":"2022-01-18","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=406935&INSPECTION_NN=406935","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"397364","date":"2021-09-27","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=397364&INSPECTION_NN=397364","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"386537","date":"2021-05-20","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":1,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"Minor issues","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=386537&INSPECTION_NN=386537","fetched":true,"findings":[{"item":16,"title":"Food-contact surfaces; cleaned and sanitized","repeat":false,"comment":"","citation":"4-601.11","citation_text":"4-601.11 Can opener blade had some debris on the blade, and a chunk of food debris was observed on the vertical bar beneath the blade. Can opener had not been used since the start of operations today and was set aside at the 3 part sink to be washed, rinsed, and sanitized. Staff noted the can opener is used maybe twice a week and is always cleaned and sanitized after use. Ensure that any other persons with access to the can opener know to properly clean and sanitize it or at minimum set it aside for cleaning after use. \nFood contact surfaces shall be clean to sight and touch. Properly clean and sanitize food contact surfaces of equipment and utensils between uses."}]},{"id":"385008","date":"2021-05-03","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=385008&INSPECTION_NN=385008","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"370363","date":"2020-09-04","visit":"Spot check","type_raw":"Spot Check","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=370363&INSPECTION_NN=370363","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"356139","date":"2020-01-29","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=356139&INSPECTION_NN=356139","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"332568","date":"2019-05-17","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJRNEgWYzzs%3d&VIOLATION_INSPECTION=332568&INSPECTION_NN=332568","fetched":true,"findings":[]},{"id":"276020","date":"2018-05-16","visit":"Routine","type_raw":"Original","risk":0,"repeat":0,"grp":0,"label":"No issues written up","detail_url":"https://public.cdpehs.com/ILEnvPbl/ESTABLISHMENT/ShowViolationTablePage.aspx?ESTABLISHMENT=9083&ESTTST_CTY=sJR